          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 35,
              "Title": "Café Edera",
              "Text": "**Café Edera** is your cozy escape just steps away — a stylish spot to enjoy fresh coffee, pastries, and light bites in a lush, modern setting. Relax, recharge or meet up in the vibrant heart of the hotel.\n\nMenus change seasonally to feature **locally sourced ingredients**, from savoury quiches and sandwiches to daily soup and salad specials.",
