              "id": 38,
              "Title": "THE GILDED LILY RESTAURANT",
              "Text": "Experience fine dining in our signature restaurant, open for dinner from 6 pm to 10 pm. Our chef curates a menu of modern Irish classics paired with international flair, showcasing the best of local produce. Sophisticated yet welcoming — your table is waiting.\n\nCall 084 754 94 to book a table.",
